@startuml SSD_EditEmployee
title SSD: UC15 - Edit Employee Contact Info

actor "Center Administrator" as Admin
participant ":System" as System

autonumber
activate Admin

Admin -> System: starts editing contact information for an Employee
activate System
System --> Admin: requests Employee Citizen Card
deactivate System

Admin -> System: inputs Citizen Card
activate System
System --> Admin: shows current contact info (Phone, Email) and requests new data
deactivate System

Admin -> System: inputs new Phone and Email
activate System

alt valid data
    System --> Admin: confirms successful update of the employee
else invalid data or employee not found
    System --> Admin: informs validation error
end

deactivate System
deactivate Admin
@enduml
